	//
	// Loop order: k (samples) -> i (row index) -> j (column index, inner).
	// - `j` is the inner/contiguous dimension of `cov`, so cov[i][*] updates
	//   for fixed i are cache‑friendly.
	// - For fixed (k, i) we load data_i[k][i] once and reuse it for all j.
